    "detailed_description": "<h1>Talk to the Dev</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Do you dare to take the mysterious gem stone?</h2>Stranded on a remote island full of ruins, his crew nowhere to be found, a pirate gets thrown back and forth in time after finding the legendary time stone and discovers a forgotten civilization that guarded an ancient secret. Still searching for his crew and a way off the island he finds enormous treasures in the past but also relentless undead guardians in the present.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/6e9b0710700a5efc765ad1bb74d693b5.avif?t=1746311008\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> uncover the secrets of the past and switch between 2 interconnected maps to explore the past and present of a cursed island</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/9e5e87e39c158eb3f644af3a38ee1f19.poster.avif?t=1746311008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/9e5e87e39c158eb3f644af3a38ee1f19.webm?t=1746311008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/9e5e87e39c158eb3f644af3a38ee1f19.mp4?t=1746311008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> solve puzzles and find useful treasure <br></li><li> find gear that will grant you new abilities to open new pathways on the map<br></li><li> every crew member you find will help you to upgrade your abilities</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/5640e4b2f25f783531e8d277f97e111a.poster.avif?t=1746311008\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/5640e4b2f25f783531e8d277f97e111a.webm?t=1746311008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688140/extras/5640e4b2f25f783531e8d277f97e111a.mp4?t=1746311008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> endure tough boss fights that can only be won by traveling through time</li></ul>",
